# structure spec for H1
W="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/"
CAT_AX="Which part of the body or which routine is it for: skin, make-up, hair, shaving and hair removal, teeth, washing and hygiene, or comfort?"
CAT_KEY=[
"1. Is it put on skin to cleanse, moisturise, treat it or shield it from sun and insects? → Skincare",
"2. Is it a colour or a tool for colouring the face, eyes, lips or nails, or a traditional mark or body paint? → Make-up",
"3. Is it for hair on the head: washing, styling, colouring, drying, heat-styling, brushing or a wig? → Hair",
"4. Does it remove hair or tend a beard: razor, shaver, hair clipper, wax, epilator, beard oil? → Shaving & hair removal",
"5. Is it for cleaning teeth, tongue or dentures? → Oral care",
"6. Is it for washing, the bath, periods, intimate or baby hygiene, or a bathroom mirror, bag or scale? → Bath, body & hygiene",
"7. Is it a massager or a heat source to ease the body? → Comfort & massage",
"<i>Precedence: a depilatory or razor is step 4 before skincare; a head hair clipper is step 4, not step 3; wipes for the face are step 6; a tinted moisturiser is a foundation (step 2) when sold for colour.</i>"]

DEPTS={
"Skincare":("Products and tools put on the skin of the face and body to cleanse, moisturise, treat or shield it; coloured products → Make-up, hair removal → Shaving & hair removal.",
 "What job does it do for the skin: cleanse and prepare it, moisturise it, treat it, or shield it?"),
"Make-up":("Coloured products and the brushes that apply them for face, eyes, lips and nails, plus traditional marks and body paint; skin treatment → Skincare, jewellery for the hair → A3.",
 "Which part is made up: the face, eyes and brows, lips, nails or a traditional mark, and is the item the colour or the tool that applies it?"),
"Hair":("Products, appliances and tools for washing, styling, colouring and holding the hair on the head, with wigs; razors and head clippers → Shaving & hair removal.",
 "What is done to the hair: wash and treat it, style it with product, change or add hair, heat-style it, or comb and hold it?"),
"Shaving & hair removal":("Razors, shavers, lather, aftercare and beard care, and ways to take hair off body or face; styling products for head hair → Hair.",
 "How is hair taken off or kept in order: by blade, with lather and aftercare, by powered shaver, from the root, or with beard products?"),
"Oral care":("Brushes, pastes, rinses and aids that clean teeth, the gaps between them, the tongue and dentures; dentist-fitted appliances and medicines are out.",
 "Which part of the mouth is cleaned and by what: brush, paste or rinse, an aid between the teeth, or a tongue and denture product?"),
"Bath, body & hygiene":("Soap, bath, period, intimate and baby hygiene products, plus the bathroom-shelf items that hold or check them; skin treatment → Skincare, scented sprays → H4.",
 "Which hygiene job does it do: wash the body, manage periods, care for intimate areas, care for a baby, or hold and check kit?"),
"Comfort & massage":("Powered and heated aids that ease muscles or warm the body; medical devices and fitness gear are out.",
 "How does it ease the body: by massage or by warmth?"),
}

